{"id":"d06780e73efa0066","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-e-class.md","title":"单指数确定性时间类 E","display":"df-e-class — 单指数确定性时间类 E","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-e-class","aliases":["28-df-e-class"],"display":"df-e-class — 单指数确定性时间类 E","depends_on":["[[28-df-dtime]]","[[28-df-characteristic-language]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 20.7 and §20.2 usage of E","source_printed_pages":"407–408","source_pdf_pages":"433–434","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-e-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-e-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-e-class — 单指数确定性时间类 E"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f982c99aef3f369e\" href=\"?note=f982c99aef3f369e\" title=\"28-df-characteristic-language\">28-df-characteristic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 20.7 and §20.2 usage of E"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"407–408"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"433–434"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a> 的容许常数因子时间类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_L:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f982c99aef3f369e\" href=\"?note=f982c99aef3f369e\" title=\"28-df-characteristic-language\">28-df-characteristic-language</a> 的特征函数定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf E\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c(n+1)}),\\qquad \\mathcal E_{01}\\coloneqq\\{\\chi_L:L\\in\\mathbf E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf E\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c(n+1)}),\\qquad \\mathcal E_{01}\\coloneqq\\{\\chi_L:L\\in\\mathbf E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>单指数中的指数对输入长度线性，区别于 EXP 的任意多项式指数。此处补出本书硬度放大与 NW 构造反复使用的独立接口；查重发现 E 原先仅在相关定理背景中出现，没有对应定义文件。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 20.7 and §20.2 usage of E；印刷页 407–408；PDF 页 433–434。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-dtime","status":"resolved","id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-dtime]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-characteristic-language","status":"resolved","id":"f982c99aef3f369e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-characteristic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-dtime","status":"resolved","id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)$ 为 [[28-df-dtime]] 的容许常数因子时间类；$\\chi_L:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 使用 [[28-df-characteristic-language]] 的特征函数定义。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-characteristic-language","status":"resolved","id":"f982c99aef3f369e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)$ 为 [[28-df-dtime]] 的容许常数因子时间类；$\\chi_L:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 使用 [[28-df-characteristic-language]] 的特征函数定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_L:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf E\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{c(n+1)}),\\qquad \\mathcal E_{01}\\coloneqq\\{\\chi_L:L\\in\\mathbf E\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1371,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-379","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-e-class]]、[[28-df-polynomial-identity-testing]]、[[28-thm-uniform-derandomization]]、[[28-thm-pit-randomized-test]]、[[28-thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["9ed6fa1ce1934897","f982c99aef3f369e"]}